        "id": 197062,
        "name": "lynkfox",
        "username": "lynkfox",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/{size}/1997_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-05-02T10:36:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Phantom5613\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/48/1906_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Phantom5613:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>How many cards has Benchmark been in, comparatively? I don't think any.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I've been starting to wonder if that is Benchmark on the back of DW Expat - there is two silhouettes on the back, one with green energy on their hands (Argent Adept?) and one with red energy on their hands (I've been assuming perhaps Empyreon, as that is the only source of red energy so far besides the back of PW and XTREME PW Tempest (but those are red lightning, not red aura). We know from the released Benchmark card that he has red aura energy around his hands. Could that scene be from the end when Revocorp forces benchmark into fighting the heroes? (as seems to be indicated from what we have been given in his story updates)</p>",
